==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)|Kagamine Rin & Len]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

